---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Support Fate Apothecary">
  <section class="about-page shell">
    <div class="about-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Support Fate Apothecary</p>
      <h1>Help keep the kitchen cooking.</h1>
      <p class="about-lede">Recipes here are meant to stay freely available. If Fate Apothecary has helped you make something delicious, you’ll eventually be able to support the project here.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>We’re still setting up the official support link. For now, consider this page reserved for future coffee-funding, recipe-fueling, and general kitchen encouragement.</p>
      <p class="about-note">Once the Buy Me a Coffee link is ready, this page can become a simple landing spot — or the nav link can go straight there instead.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
